{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA-n2000 encoding with no image data or fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 of 0.4639. These results suggest RNA-only models underperform compared to multimodal baselines (e.g., 0.5266 accuracy in config_001), indicating potential value in incorporating image data. Uncertainty remains about whether alternative RNA encoders or profile settings could improve performance, as this baseline lacks comparative experiments with other modalities or aggregation methods."
}

